Cell["\<\
We find that we have in this instance become trapped in endless circulation \
around a box. At \[Tau] = 2.542 we end up circulating around a kind of \
\"paperclip\":\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.395685707189384*^9, 3.395685786074389*^9}}],

