Cell["\<\
I can hear you say \"The similarity of the figures is hardly surprising, \
since the maps from which they originate are so similar.'' Consider, \
therefore, this quite different map:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3956938297487183`*^9, 3.395693832522171*^9}, {
